      "cooked": "<p>Hey Everyone,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just got a small question about the 4th Expansion and Kickstarter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read in the comments:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"If you pledge the additional 40$ and we will not hit the 150$k mark, you will get&nbsp;<span>Vengence later and you dont lose the money\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>So is it correct? So that means you are preordering indirectly on&nbsp;</span><span>Vengence when you add the 40$ ?!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>And also the question:</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>If its correct, will &gt;G deliver this also too Essen for some EU backers?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Thanks :)</span><span>&nbsp;from Germany :D</span></p>",
