      "raw": "<p>Hey Everyone,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I just got a small question about the 4th Expansion and Kickstarter.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I read in the comments:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&quot;If you pledge the additional 40$ and we will not hit the 150$k mark, you will get&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">Vengence later and you dont lose the money&quot;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">So is it correct? So that means you are preordering indirectly on&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">Vengence when you add the 40$ ?!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">And also the question:</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">If its correct, will &gt;G deliver this also too Essen for some EU backers?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;\">Thanks :)</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;from Germany :D</span></p>",
