      "created_at": "2012-11-19T11:42:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That is what they've said. We're expecting a more official announcement later today but my expectation is that if we get to 150K for Vengeance, they will be available for pickup at Essen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And it is my understadning that pledging the extra $40 (or $80 for international shipping) is a preorder for Vengence when it's published. If we get to $150K that's this year, otherwise ist's sometime next. But that is my understanding rather than an official position.</p>",
